    "natali_inf": "\"Natali Pharm Bonus\" card is a cumulative card. In case of shopping in “Natali Pharm\" pharmacy and “Yerevan City” supermarkets networks, if you have a “Natali Pharm Bonus\" card with you accumulate some points, which will automatically accumulated in your personal account. \n \n  By the way, the bonuses which were accumulated in “Yerevan City”, you can use them only there, and the same with “Natali Pharm”, if your bonuses are from “Natali Pharm\", you can use them only in “Natali Pharm”.\n \n  With your accumulated points you can do shopping whenever you want, both in “Natali Pharm\" and in “Yerevan City”, just you need to show the cashier your “Natali Pharm Bonus\" cumulative card every time you do shopping.\n \n  In this way you are now limited with some sales, just you buy necessary for you products with your accumulated points. \n \n You can get “Natali Pharm Bonus\" card from “Natali Pharm\" Pharmacy networks for 500 AMD, which already contains 500 bonuses.\n \n HOW TO ACCUMULATE POINTS IN \"NATALI PHARM\" PHARMACY NETWORKSThe conditions of accumulating points: While shopping in “Natali Pharm” Pharmacy networks, you will get 2 points for each 100 AMD with your “Natali Pharm” or “Yerevan City” bonus card (main condition).\n \n  Each card owner will have the opportunity to mention 2 products in “Natali Pharm” pharmacy network, which he will buy once a month, accumulating five points for each 100 AMD with that one. By the way, the consumers have the right to change the product each month. If you buy a product from the list of “special offerings” you will get 3 points for each 100HOW TO ACCUMULATE POINTS IN \"YEREVAN CITY\" SUPERMARKETS NETWORKSThe conditions of accumulating points: While shopping in “Yerevan City” you get 1 point for each 100 AMD (the main condition).\n \n  For that you just need to show your “Natali Pharm Bonus” card to the cashier. \n \n The whole amount of your points and the points which were get from that shopping will be submitted in the lower part of the cashiers coupon.\n \n 1. If you wish to collect your points faster, you can enjoy our special conditions.1.If your purchases exceed 3000 AMD, you will get +1 point for each 100 AMD2.If you do you shopping from 01.00-13.00 you will get +1 point for each 100 AMD3. If you buy from the list of “special offering”, you will get +1 point for each 100 AMD4. \n \n If you do your shopping in your birthday you will get +3 points for each 100 AMDSo if you do your shopping for 3000 AMD, at 01.00 until 13.00, with (Special Offering) label, at your birthday you will get 1+1+1+1+3=7 point for each 100 AMD, therefore from 3000 AMD you will have 210 AMD, which will give you a unique 7% sale.When you do your shopping you can use only one promotion provided by Yerevan City Supermarkets.\n \n  For example, when you buy such products which have lowered price, you cant use your points for them, or you get maximum 1 point and not more, because they are already in sale.Dear consumers, we want to warn you, while shopping you use your accumulated points, for that very products you wont accumulate points.HOW TO ACCUMLATE OR SPEND YOUR ACCUMLATED POINTS IN \"NATALI PHARM\" AND \"YEREVAN CITY\"If you have fill the blank of getting “Natali Pham Bonus” card right, then from that very moment you can accumulate points, which you can use 20 days after handing the blank.\n \n  If you have filled the necessary parts of your blank wrong, than you wont be able to use your accumulated points, until all the information is corrected.\n \n  You can spend your points for all products, wholly or partially or you accumulate for a long time,\n \n  1 point for 1 AMD. By the way, the accumulated bonuses you can spend only in “Yerevan City”, if you have gained those bonuses from there, and the same with “Natali Pharm” pharmacy network. \n \n The spent points are submitted in lower part of the cashiers coupon, separately for Yerevan City and for Natali Pharm. Pay attention on the condition that you can use your points only when you show your “Natali Pharm Bonus” card to the cashier and will submit your PIN code correct.\n \n  You will get your PIN code with the message, during 20 days until you get your “Natali Pharm Bonus” card. \n \n In the case of losing your PIN code, send a message to the 7500 number, in the place of the text write N letter and the six number code of your card (exemple: NXXXXXX), from the number which was mentioned in your “Natali Pharm Bonus” cards blank. The cost of one message is 120 AMD.WHAT DO IN CASE OF LOSING THE CARDImmediately call to (093)72.91.73, (055)72.16.20, (095)72.06.20 numbers and ask the operator to block the card. Visit one of the “Natali Pharm” pharmacy networks whenever you can, and get a new “Natali Pharm Bonus” card with the same conditions, fill the blank as the previous one and mention above. “I ask you to move my “Natali pharm Bonus” cards lost points to the new “Natali Pharm Bonus” cards account”.\n \n  If the information is corresponded after 15 days all your accumulated points both form “Natali Pharm” and “Yerevan City”, will be moved to your new Bonus cards account. For more information you can: visit “Natali Pharm” Pharmacy network call: (093)72.91.73 (055)72.06.20 (095)72.06.20",
